  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br />Integrating, we get<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>dy</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br />As it passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Thus, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />which also passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
